5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I am Minato. I hope we can find the truth together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,Greetings. I am Benjamin. Let us proceed with logic and care.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Peace be with you. I am Servas. Wisdom guides us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Hi there! I'm May. Let's make this fun, shall we?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Hey. I'm Takumi. I won't back down from this.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,I feel a bit nervous. Who should we trust first?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Trust is earned through consistency. Let's observe their words.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is key. Do not rush to judgment, my young friends.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,I agree with Servas. Rushing leads to mistakes. Let's chat.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I don't like waiting. But I'll listen for now.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,That sounds reasonable. I will try to stay calm.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Good. Calmness allows for clearer thinking. Keep it up.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The mind must be clear to see the path.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,I'm feeling pretty confident already. Let's see who blinks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Blinking? I don't blink. I stare until they break.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I think we are all ready for the night.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Let the night reveal its secrets.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"May the stars guide our steps. Goodnight, all.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight! Sweet dreams, or nightmares for the wolves.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Goodnight. I'll be watching.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
